    """sum_to_n is a function that sums numbers from 1 to n.
    Returns 0 if n <= 0.

    >>> sum_to_n(30)
    465
    >>> sum_to_n(100)
    5050
    >>> sum_to_n(5)
    15
    >>> sum_to_n(10)
    55
